			<div class="col-lg-9">
			
				<article id="entry">
					<div id="post" class="has-edit-buttons">
						
						<div id="breadcrumbs">
							<ul><li><a href="https://www.newportoregon.gov/./">Home</a> </li><li><a href="https://www.newportoregon.gov/emergency_preparedness/index.php">Emergency&nbsp;Preparedness</a> </li><li><a href="https://www.newportoregon.gov/emergency_preparedness/earthquake___tsunami/index.php">Earthquake&nbsp;/&nbsp;Tsunami</a> </li><li>Evacuation&nbsp;Maps</li></ul>
						</div>
						<h1 id="page-title">



Tsunami Evacuation Maps</h1>
						



<div class="rz-btns-container">

	

	<script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">

		RZ.module = 'freeform';

		RZ.nexturl = 'editforms/freeform-editform.jsp?';

		RZ.img = '<span class="rzBtn">Edit Content</span>';

		RZ.set = 'pageid=links-2775';

		RZ.options = '';

		if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('editform');

	</script>

	

	


	

</div>

<p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Knowing your evacuation routes before an emergency can save lives. The maps below show generalized evacuation routes. The needed tsunami evacuation speeds shown on the maps represent the speeds required to escape a maximum considered tsunami generated from a local Cascadia subduction zone earthquake. You can print these&nbsp;<span class="font-weight-bold">page-size</span> (8.5 x 11 inch) PDF maps on your printer at a readable scale. Take time to practice your tsunami evacuation plan and route.</span><br /><br /><span style="font-size: 28px;">What to Do During an Evacuation</span></p>
<ul>
<li data-start="865" data-end="910"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Move quickly to your nearest assembly area.</span></li>
<li data-start="865" data-end="910"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Do not wait for official instructions if you feel strong shaking or see rapid water withdrawal; evacuate immediately.</span></li>
<li data-start="865" data-end="910"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Take your emergency kit if it is readily available.</span></li>
<li data-start="865" data-end="910"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Plan ahead to know which route is closest to your home, workplace, or lodging.</span></li>
</ul>
<hr />
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>"Beat the Wave" Tsunami Evacuation Route Maps</strong></span></p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;" border="0" cellpadding="10px">
<tbody>
<tr>
